00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.510
- Affleck's got muscles.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:36.648
When he holds you, you feel held.

00:03:36.648 --> 00:03:37.481
- Well.

00:03:37.481 --> 00:03:39.810
- Batman, Matt Reeves's
Batman, you on board?

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:42.130
Got Jonah Hill as either "The
Penguin" or "The Riddler"

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:45.224
we're not sure, maybe a
combination of both? "The Peddler"?

00:03:45.224 --> 00:03:46.057
